One more little glitch in Nitrohack:
When I price-identify multiple items by dropping them in a shop,
the prices are not shown in the message window. And neither can I see
them with ^P.
They show ONLY in the prompt for selling the item.
It's a little frustrating when I'd like to check again the price of the
previous item in the middle of the process. I first have to finish
dropping the whole batch, then pick up the one item and drop it again.
Nethack shows the prices of the previous items with ^P even in the
middle of the batch.

